('procurement','3.1','Is there an approved end-to-end procurement policy covering requisition, sourcing, approval, receiving, payment, exceptions and record retention?','Procurement & Vendor Management','Governance & Authority','Approved policy; revision history; employee acknowledgment',5,0.1,'No'),
